    {
      "rank": 16,
      "row_id": 245613,
      "chunk_id": "c1e01df4c15d_0",
      "doc_id": "c1e01df4c15d",
      "text": "Great Phone, Just Be Sure to Get New Battery. The phone arrived in (practically) new condition. From day one I noticed the battery life was poor, so I took the advice from another reviewer and had a new battery installed by Apple. While at Apple, the technician checked over the phone (inside and out) and said that the phone was in good condition and ran as it was supposed to. I’ve had the phone for a little over two weeks now and I’d say I’m pretty happy with the purchase. I bought a refurbished phone from Amazon about a year ago, but it was a little more worn and did not function properly. So I’m happy this one worked out AND that Amazon has a great return policy for the phones if it doesn’t perform as it should. It gave me a huge piece of mind.",
      "score": 0.03231201811512838,
      "brand": "Apple",
